{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>וכל.</b> Some say אצלתי is from אצל, and the meaning is 'I thus took from beside them'; it is from the light binyan, whereas ויאצל is from the heavy binyan. It would have been fitting to show the alef, as in יחזק במעוזי, which is from החזיק. <b>ושמחתי בעמלי</b> — was the reward of my toil, and it alone was my portion."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:05.912796920Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}